        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"3ef51825-2a7e-4294-aa64-84eb5d48800d\",\"review_text\":\"Love, love, love Spotify !\"},{\"review_id\":\"a5a3cb8e-80f7-45d8-b759-3170b77480ad\",\"review_text\":\"This app is amazing. Definitely recommend it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a8af5452-dbe9-476d-bade-dbce60b8e0aa\",\"review_text\":\"Happy song\"},{\"review_id\":\"2040fc3b-6662-4c84-bea9-9c5276d0563b\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing interface, quality music, and definitely worth my money to be honest. Premium makes it so much better. I could live without it, but not after using it for a while.\"},{\"review_id\":\"82c2333b-a963-4e19-ab8e-da9caf555d87\",\"review_text\":\"Awful everything req premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"b74dd51b-bae2-437e-91bb-33d25ac8d5d0\",\"review_text\":\"Very worst 😞 Subscription method is very disappointed ☹️\"},{\"review_id\":\"2fa0288a-ddc9-491b-83bb-1d33a4958eb6\",\"review_text\":\"Its good for the most and i use this app every day but keeps on playing over other apps when spotify 'was not suppost to be open' and it comes randomly and then skips songs at random. It also deleted a few of my favourite songs from a show i liked and i dont have premium so i dont get to listen to them ever again... with all of this though i still really like the app because of how easy it is to use and i love the karaoke feature,,, ads r a bit over the top tho\"},{\"review_id\":\"97982fee-a65f-4fed-9dd5-9ffb31efbee0\",\"review_text\":\"I always get \\\"No internet available\\\" error even if the internet is working\"},{\"review_id\":\"23e9321b-39c8-48b1-af18-351ba820207d\",\"review_text\":\"In between too many ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"818d7556-7eb1-4a00-9ba6-6b51e42c23df\",\"review_text\":\"Bad\"}]}"
